---
---
<section class="relative min-h-[100dvh] flex items-end">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/images/guangxi-hero.webp"
      alt="Li River karst peaks rising from the water near Guilin, Guangxi"
      width="1672"
      height="941"
      class="hero-zoom w-full h-full object-cover"
      loading="eager"
      decoding="async"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-950/90 via-brand-950/40 to-brand-950/10"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full pb-16 md:pb-24 pt-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white max-w-3xl pb-1">
      Guangxi Province Travel Guide: Beyond Guilin
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/85 max-w-2xl mt-5 leading-relaxed">
      Karst peaks, a volcanic island, a Vietnam-border waterfall and the world's favorite noodle soup.
      <span class="text-white font-semibold">One page. No ten tabs. Read it and book.</span>
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8">
      <a href="#matcher" class="px-6 py-3 bg-white text-brand-900 rounded-full font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-brand-50 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">
        Find your match
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#itineraries" class="px-6 py-3 bg-brand-700/80 text-white rounded-full font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-brand-700 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">
        See the 7-day route
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 3l5 5-5 5"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 mt-8 text-xs text-white/70">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Independent guide</span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>No sponsorship</span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Prices checked quarterly</span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Firsthand travel</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
